{"v":4,"catch":"可愛但具有挑戰性的迷宮！","desc":"《THE NEWZEALAND STORY》是TAITO於1988年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n控制英雄 TIKI 踏上冒險之旅，從海豹手中救出你的寶貝 Phee-phee。\n每個階段都是一個龐大的迷宮。 為目標而戰，使用氣球進行浮動動作遊戲！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-01-26","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f77c7b363322b600c5c1789315259d574f6f1041226685fc0956f34cb7e80d84.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb296103cea5d878430fa383828bbc782340fe76d0bbc0ff6f251cf0d4dda7b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b3a8ad50a444ad2246f7c663d0c9ad416b99342317116c2ef19073852c031308.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5eeac722d02de9f9f31ecacce7e4f46230c7d918bcee689816d0152080805bca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0fb51a4aad5187c04df6c7a3ae34e65e68c33e868acba02388c9cbb4acd637c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/44b2fa9be58bf023d777fd9fe5a1b3a25dbf62e2e20ee054afdd3d1f58c5bd44.jpg"],"titleId":"010045d019ff0000","dlc":[]}